+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Shipped              |
+
+The tool registry is the boundary between model-produced calls and application executors, so it owns checking the schema that providers receive for each tool.
+
+## Execution
+
+The registry validates each input against the resolved tool definition's JSON Schema before the executor runs ([validated by: returns a required-field rejection before invoking the executor and retains a static compilation](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L14)). A rejected call returns a `ToolResponse` describing its failing required field or type without including submitted values; the executor is not called ([validated by: returns a required-field rejection before invoking the executor and retains a static compilation](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L14), [rejects a wrong-typed value without exposing it and forwards valid extra keys unchanged once](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L40)). Schema-valid unknown properties are forwarded unchanged and only one executor invocation occurs ([validated by: rejects a wrong-typed value without exposing it and forwards valid extra keys unchanged once](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L40)).
+
+## Schema lifetime
+
+A static schema is compiled during registration and retained across later executions ([validated by: returns a required-field rejection before invoking the executor and retains a static compilation](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L14)). A function-valued definition is resolved and validated against the schema it returns for that execution ([validated by: uses the schema currently returned by a definition source on every execution](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L61)). An invalid static definition fails during registration and identifies the tool that could not be registered ([validated by: rejects an uncompilable static schema at registration time and names its tool](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L88)).
